 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Jigoku no Sata mo Ougon Shidai ~ Kaisha o Kubi ni natta Kedo, Renkinjutsu Toka Iu Cheat Skill o te ni Ireta no de Jinsei Ippatsu Gyakuten o Mezashimasu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "地獄の沙汰も黄金次第　会社をクビになったけど、錬金術とかいうチートスキルを手に入れたので人生一発逆転を目指します（コミック）"
   },
   {
    "en": "Even Hell’s Affairs Depend on Gold ~ I Got Fired, but I’ve Acquired an Alchemy Cheat Skill, So I’m Aiming for a Major Life Turnaround"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Thirty years have passed since the world and the otherworld known as the Frontier were connected. \n\nCountries around the world began exploring the Frontier in search of new resources. Now, if they have the qualifications, even civilians can go through the gate and enter the Frontier. And so, the profession of bringing back resources and selling them, the adventurer, was born. \n\nOkita was suddenly fired from his company. With barely any savings, he became an adventurer to make a living. On his first adventure, Okita acquired the skill of alchemy. \n\nFrom that moment on, Okita Hajime's life began to shine with gold. At the same time, the Golden Witch was born, who would break the common sense of the world.",
   "ja": "世界とフロンティアと呼ばれる世界が繋がり30年。\n\n世界中国々は新たなる資源を求め、フロンティアを探索し始めた。 現在は資格があれば、民間人でもゲートをくぐり、フロンティアに行けるようになっていた。そして、資源を持ち帰り売却する職業、冒険者が誕生する―。\n\n 突然会社をクビになった沖田。ロクに貯金もないので、生活をするために冒険者となることに。沖田は、初めての冒険で錬金術というスキルを手に入れる。 \n\nこの瞬間から沖田ハジメの人生は黄金に輝き始める。それと同時に世界の常識を壊す【黄金の魔女】が誕生した。"
  },
